{"id":"22825d76e4968201","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-eigenvariable.md","title":"Eigenvariable","display":"df-eigenvariable — Eigenvariable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-eigenvariable","aliases":["72-df-eigenvariable"],"display":"df-eigenvariable — Eigenvariable","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3.2 print32/PDF44; translated from separate free/bound variables","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-eigenvariable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-eigenvariable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-eigenvariable — Eigenvariable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3.2 print32/PDF44; translated from separate free/bound variables"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的五分量签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\">\\(X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限序列以自然数为定义域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Gamma\">\\(A,\\Gamma\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\\)</span>。多个逗号按次序串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的语法有序对。</li>\n<li>本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in V\">\\(y\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>；公式与相继式的自由变量运算均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eigen}(y;\\Gamma,\\Delta,QxA):\\Longleftrightarrow y\\in V\\land y\\notin\\left(\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\Delta)}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(QxA)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Eigen}(y;\\Gamma,\\Delta,QxA):\\Longleftrightarrow y\\in V\\land y\\notin\\left(\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\Delta)}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(QxA)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>新鲜性检查整个结论；与原书自由/约束两类变量的约定通过改名对应。在本地单类变量语法中还明确要求实例化自由代入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的五分量签名；$X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)$，$\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma$，$A,B$ 遍历 $X_\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有限序列以自然数为定义域，$\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}$；$\\Gamma,A$ 缩写 $\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle$，$A,\\Gamma$ 缩写 $\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma$。多个逗号按次序串接。$\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma$ 是 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]] 的语法有序对。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；$\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle$，$\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle$，见 [[72-df-sequent-rule]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$y\\in V$，$x\\in V$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$；公式与相继式的自由变量运算均取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 与 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$y\\in V$，$x\\in V$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$；公式与相继式的自由变量运算均取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 与 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A,\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eigen}(y;\\Gamma,\\Delta,QxA):\\Longleftrightarrow y\\in V\\land y\\notin\\left(\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\Delta)}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(QxA)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1931,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-eigenvariable|df-eigenvariable — Eigenvariable]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-eigenvariable — Eigenvariable](72-df-eigenvariable.md)"},{"id":"55bc01ae9fd27543","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cf4099999609d5eb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"67654043764cc31b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Σ 仅有一元关系 P、无常元和函数；$\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\{0,1\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle P,\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle$。$\\eta$ 将全部对象变量赋为0，$x:=v_1,y:=v_0$。Eigen 与相继式语义取 [[72-df-eigenvariable]]、[[72-df-sequent-validity]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-eigenvariable|df-eigenvariable — Eigenvariable]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-eigenvariable]]"}],"outgoing":["f9452e4a7788a117","3c073b947b255638","d940a4cbbc0bf9c9"]}